msgid "Target quadrature accuracy (GRIDTHR)"
msgstr "目标求积精度 (GRIDTHR)"

msgid ""
"Specify the target accuracy of integration. If options ``GRIDTHR_RAD`` and "
"``GRIDTHR_ANG`` are missing, radial and angular grids are generated "
"adaptively, with the aim of integrating a model functional to the specified "
"accuracy. *acc* is an overall target accuracy, and is the one that should "
"normally be used; radial and angular grid target accuracies are generated "
"algorithmically from it, namely, the scaled values *accr*\\ =\\ *acc*/2 and "
"*acca*\\ =\\ *acc*/10 will then be used. However, they can be adjusted "
"individually by using the options ``GRIDTHR_RAD`` and ``GRIDTHR_ANG`` "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"指定积分的目标准确度。如果选项 ``GRIDTHR_RAD`` 和 ``GRIDTHR_ANG`` "
"缺失，则会自适应生成径向和角向网格，旨在将模型泛函积分到指定的精度。\\ *acc* "
"是一个整体目标准确度，通常是应该使用的那个；径向和角向网格的目标准确度是根据它算法生成的，即随后将使用缩放值 *accr*\\ =\\ *acc*/2 "
"和 *acca*\\ =\\ *acc*/10。然而，它们可以分别通过使用选项 ``GRIDTHR_RAD`` 和 ``GRIDTHR_ANG`` "
"进行单独调整。"

msgid "Setting a global level for the accuracy of the grid (GRIDACC)"
msgstr "设置网格精度的全局级别 (GRIDACC)"

msgid ""
"The accuracy of the numerical quadrature depends on a number of different "
"parameters whose effect may not be very transparent for the user. However, a"
" fine-tuning of the grid parameters in order to control the accuracy of the "
"grid is not necessary when using the global option ``GRIDACC`` that can have"
" the four values *default*,\\ *low*,\\ *high* and *veryhigh*. ``GRIDACC``\\ "
"=\\ *default* uses sensible settings for the grid parameters that should "
"suffice for most kinds of calculations and is set by default. In contrast, "
"``GRIDACC``\\ =\\ *low* may be used when the accuracy of the DFT integration"
" is not so relevant (e.g., for computing starting guesses) and ``GRIDACC``\\"
" =\\ *high* or ``GRIDACC``\\ =\\ *veryhigh* are recommended for benchmark "
"calculations. The setting of ``GRIDACC``\\ =\\ *old* is for keeping "
"backwards compatibility with older versions of Molpro (< 2021.x) where the "
"default values for the grid parameters differed from the current ones."
msgstr ""
"数值求积的精度取决于多个不同参数，这些参数的影响对用户而言可能不太直观。然而，当使用全局选项 ``GRIDACC`` "
"时，无需为了控制网格精度而对网格参数进行微调，该选项可以取四个值：\\ *default*\\ 、\\ *low*\\ 、\\ *high* 和 "
"*veryhigh*\\ 。\\ ``GRIDACC``\\ =\\ *default* "
"使用合理的网格参数设置，应能满足大多数类型的计算需求，并且是默认设置。相反，当 DFT 积分的精度不那么重要时（例如，用于计算初始猜测），可以使用 "
"``GRIDACC``\\ =\\ *low*\\ ；而对于基准计算，则推荐使用 ``GRIDACC``\\ =\\ *high* 或 "
"``GRIDACC``\\ =\\ *veryhigh*\\ 。设置 ``GRIDACC``\\ =\\ *old* 是为了保持与旧版 Molpro（<"
" 2021.x）的向后兼容性，旧版本中网格参数的默认值与当前版本不同。"

msgid "Radial integration grid (RADIAL)"
msgstr "径向积分网格 (RADIAL)"

msgid ""
"Specify the details of the radial quadrature scheme. A number of different "
"radial schemes are available, specified by *method* = ``EM``, ``BECKE``, "
"``AHLRICHS``, ``MULTIEXP``, ``DE2``, ``MK2CG`` or ``LOG``, with the latter "
"being the default."
msgstr ""
"指定径向求积方案的细节。有多种不同的径向方案可用，由 *method* = ``EM``\\ 、\\ ``BECKE``\\ 、\\ "
"``AHLRICHS``\\ 、\\ ``MULTIEXP``\\ 、\\ ``DE2``\\ 、\\ ``MK2CG`` 或 ``LOG`` "
"指定，其中后者为默认值。"

msgid ""
"``EM|EULER-MACLAURIN`` is the Euler-Maclaurin scheme defined by C. W. "
"Murray, N. C. Handy and G. J. Laming, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268979300100651>`__ **78**, 997 (1993). "
":math:`m_r`, for which the default value is 2, is defined in equation (6) of"
" the above as"
msgstr ""
"``EM|EULER-MACLAURIN`` 是由 C. W. Murray、N. C. Handy 和 G. J. Laming 定义的 Euler-"
"Maclaurin 方案，见 `Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268979300100651>`__"
" **78**, 997 (1993)。\\ :math:`m_r` 的默认值为 2，在上述文献的方程 (6) 中定义为"

msgid "r = \\alpha {x^{m_r}\\over (1-x)^{m_r}}"
msgstr ""
"r = \\alpha {x^{m_r}\\over (1-x)^{m_r}}\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"whilst *scale* (default value 1) multiplied by the Bragg-Slater radius of "
"the atom gives the scaling parameter :math:`\\alpha`."
msgstr "\\ 而 *scale*\\ （默认值 1）乘以原子的 Bragg-Slater 半径得到缩放参数 :math:`\\alpha`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``LOG|MURA-KNOWLES`` is the scheme described by M. E. Mura and P. J. "
"Knowles, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.471749>`__ **104**, "
"9848 (1996). It is based on the transformation"
msgstr ""
"``LOG|MURA-KNOWLES`` 是 M. E. Mura 和 P. J. Knowles 描述的方案，见 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.471749>`__ **104**, 9848 (1996)。它基于变换"

msgid "r = - \\alpha \\log_e (1-x^{m_r})\\; ,"
msgstr ""
"r = - \\alpha \\log_e (1-x^{m_r})\\; ,\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"with :math:`0\\le x \\le 1` and simple Gauss quadrature in :math:`x`-space. "
"The recommended value of :math:`m_r` is 3 for molecular systems, giving rise"
" to the Log3 grid; :math:`m_r`\\ =4 is more efficient for atoms. "
":math:`\\alpha` is taken to be *scale* times the recommended value for "
":math:`\\alpha` given by Mura and Knowles, and *scale* defaults to 1."
msgstr ""
"\\ 其中 :math:`0\\le x \\le 1`\\ ，并在 :math:`x` 空间中使用简单的高斯求积。对于分子体系，\\ "
":math:`m_r` 的推荐值为 3，由此产生 Log3 网格；对于原子，\\ :math:`m_r`\\ =4 更高效。\\ "
":math:`\\alpha` 取为 *scale* 乘以 Mura 和 Knowles 给出的 :math:`\\alpha` 推荐值，\\ "
"*scale* 默认为 1。"

msgid ""
"r = \\alpha {(1+x)\\over (1-x)} \\; ,\n"
"\\label{eqn:Becke}"
msgstr ""
"r = \\alpha {(1+x)\\over (1-x)} \\; ,\n"
"\\label{eqn:Becke}"

msgid ""
"using points in :math:`-1\\le x \\le +1` and standard Gauss-Chebyshev "
"quadrature of the second kind for the :math:`x`-space quadrature. Becke "
"chose his scaling parameters to be half the Bragg-Slater radius except for "
"hydrogen, for which the whole Bragg-Slater radius was used, and setting "
"*scale* to a value other than 1 allows a different :math:`\\alpha` to be "
"used. :math:`m_r` is not necessary for this radial scheme."
msgstr ""
"\\ 使用点 :math:`-1\\le x \\le +1` 和标准的第二类高斯-切比雪夫求积法进行 :math:`x` 空间求积。Becke "
"选择其缩放参数为布拉格-斯莱特半径的一半，但氢原子除外，氢原子使用整个布拉格-斯莱特半径，将 *scale* 设置为非 1 的值允许使用不同的 "
":math:`\\alpha`\\ 。此径向方案不需要 :math:`m_r`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``AHLRICHS`` is the radial scheme defined by O. Treutler and R. Ahlrichs, "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.469408>`__ **102**, 346 "
"(1995). It is based on the transformation (their M4 mapping)"
msgstr ""
"``AHLRICHS`` 是由 O. Treutler 和 R. Ahlrichs 定义的径向方案，\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.469408>`__ **102**, 346 (1995)。它基于变换（他们的 M4 "
"映射）"

msgid "r= {\\alpha \\over \\log_e 2} (1+x)^{0.6} \\log_e\\left( {2\\over 1-x}\\right)\\; ,"
msgstr ""
"r= {\\alpha \\over \\log_e 2} (1+x)^{0.6} \\log_e\\left( {2\\over 1-x}\\right)\\; ,\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"with using standard Gauss-Chebyshev quadrature of the second kind for the "
":math:`x`-space integration. :math:`m_r` is not necessary for this radial "
"scheme."
msgstr "\\ 使用标准的第二类高斯-切比雪夫求积法进行 :math:`x` 空间积分。此径向方案不需要 :math:`m_r`\\ 。"

msgid "x_i = \\cos\\left(i \\pi \\over n+1 \\right)"
msgstr ""
"x_i = \\cos\\left(i \\pi \\over n+1 \\right)\n"
"\n"

msgid "r=\\exp(\\alpha x_i-e^{-x_i})"
msgstr ""
"r=\\exp(\\alpha x_i-e^{-x_i})\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
":math:`n_0`, :math:`n_1`, :math:`n_2`, :math:`n_3` are the degrees of "
"quadrature :math:`n_r` (see equation (3) of Murray et al.), for "
"hydrogen/helium, first row, second row, and other elements respectively."
msgstr ""
":math:`n_0`\\ 、\\ :math:`n_1`\\ 、\\ :math:`n_2`\\ 、\\ :math:`n_3` "
"分别是针对氢/氦、第一行、第二行和其他元素的求积度 :math:`n_r`\\ （参见 Murray 等人的方程 (3)）。"

msgid ""
"where :math:`accr` is the threshold and :math:`n_A` is the period of atom."
msgstr "其中 :math:`accr` 是阈值，\\ :math:`n_A` 是原子的周期。"

msgid "``GRID,name=PRUNED,min_nr=[Row1,Row2,Row3,Row4+]``"
msgstr "``GRID,name=PRUNED,min_nr=[Row1,Row2,Row3,Row4+]``"

msgid "and"
msgstr "和"

msgid "``GRID,name=PRUNED,max_nr=[Row1,Row2,Row3,Row4+]``"
msgstr "``GRID,name=PRUNED,max_nr=[Row1,Row2,Row3,Row4+]``"

msgid "for each atom based on its periodic row."
msgstr "针对每个原子，基于其周期表中的行。"

msgid "Angular integration grid (ANGULAR)"
msgstr "角向积分网格 (ANGULAR)"

msgid ""
"Each type of grid specifies a family of which the various members are "
"characterized by a single quantum number :math:`l`; spherical harmonics up "
"to degree :math:`l` are integrated exactly. :math:`l^{\\text{min}}_i` and "
":math:`l^{\\text{max}}_i, i=0,1,2,3` specify allowed ranges of :math:`l` for"
" H–Be, B–Ca, Sc–Ba, and La– respectively. The :math:`l^{\\text{min}}_i` are "
"further moderated at run time so that for any given atom they are not less "
"than :math:`2i+4` or twice the maximum angular momentum of the basis set on "
"the atom; this constraint can be overridden by giving a negative value in "
"``LMIN``, and in this case just its absolute value will be used as the lower"
" bound. For the Lebedev grids, if the value of :math:`l` is not one of the "
"set implemented in Molpro (3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 19, 23, 29, 41, 47, "
"53), then :math:`l` is increased to give the next largest angular grid "
"available. In general, different radial points will have different "
":math:`l`, and in the absence of any moderation described below, will be "
"taken from :math:`l^{\\text{max}}_i`."
msgstr ""
"每种类型的网格定义了一个族，其各个成员由单个量子数 :math:`l` 表征；直到 :math:`l` 次的球谐函数都能被精确积分。\\ "
":math:`l^{\\text{min}}_i` 和 :math:`l^{\\text{max}}_i, i=0,1,2,3` 分别指定了 "
"H–Be、B–Ca、Sc–Ba 和 La– 元素允许的 :math:`l` 值范围。\\ :math:`l^{\\text{min}}_i` "
"在运行时会被进一步调整，使得对于任何给定原子，其值不小于 :math:`2i+4` 或该原子上基组最大角动量的两倍；此约束可以通过在 ``LMIN`` "
"中给出负值来覆盖，在这种情况下，仅其绝对值将被用作下界。对于 Lebedev 网格，如果 :math:`l` 的值不是 Molpro "
"中已实现的集合（3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 19, 23, 29, 41, 47, 53）中的一个，那么 :math:`l`"
" 会被增加到下一个可用的最大角向网格。通常，不同的径向点会有不同的 :math:`l`\\ ，在没有下文描述的任何调整的情况下，将从 "
":math:`l^{\\text{max}}_i` 中取值。"

msgid ""
"*acca* is a target energy accuracy. It is used to reduce :math:`l` for a "
"given radial point as far as possible below :math:`l^{\\text{max}}_i` but "
"not lower than :math:`l^{\\text{max}}_i`. The implementation uses the error "
"in the angular integral of the kernel of a model functional using a sum of "
"approximate atomic densities. If *acca* is zero, the global threshold is "
"used instead, or else it is ignored."
msgstr ""
"*acca* 是一个目标能量精度。它用于将给定径向点的 :math:`l` 尽可能降低到 :math:`l^{\\text{max}}_i` "
"以下，但不低于 :math:`l^{\\text{max}}_i`\\ 。该实现使用基于近似原子密度和的一个模型泛函核的角向积分误差。如果 *acca*"
" 为零，则使用全局阈值，否则忽略它。"

msgid "Pruning integrand and neighbour atoms in grid generation (FACNEIGH)"
msgstr "网格生成中的被积函数修剪和邻近原子 (FACNEIGH)"

msgid ""
"The test functional is computed from the superposition of (Slater) atomic "
"densities including the atom itself, plus a set of neighbour atoms. The "
"latter includes all atoms that are within a range of ``DIST``\\*\\ "
"``FACNEIGH`` apart from the atom with ``DIST`` being the (squared!) distance"
" of the closest atom. ``FACNEIGH`` is currently set to 4.0 by default and "
"governs the shape of the test density on the sphere. Increasing this value "
"will implicitly lead to more angular points at (particularly) large radial "
"grid points but also increases the overall accuracy of the quadrature. For "
"benchmark calculations it can be therefore recommended to set ``FACNEIGH`` "
"larger than the current threshold. Note that the same can also be achieved "
"by reducing the value of the overall ``GRIDTHR`` threshold value, yet, it "
"has been found that resetting ``FACNEIGH`` can be more effective for "
"intermediate sized grids."
msgstr ""
"测试泛函由（斯莱特）原子密度的叠加计算得出，包括原子本身以及一组邻近原子。后者包括所有距离该原子在 ``DIST``\\ \\*\\ "
"``FACNEIGH`` 范围内的原子，其中 ``DIST`` 是最近原子的（平方！）距离。\\ ``FACNEIGH`` 当前默认设置为 "
"4.0，并控制球面上测试密度的形状。增加此值将隐式导致在（特别是）大的径向网格点处有更多的角向点，但也提高了求积的整体精度。因此，对于基准计算，建议将 "
"``FACNEIGH`` 设置为大于当前阈值。请注意，通过降低整体 ``GRIDTHR`` "
"阈值值也可以达到同样的效果，然而，已经发现对于中等大小的网格，重置 ``FACNEIGH`` 可能更有效。"

msgid "Atom partitioning of integration grid (VORONOI)"
msgstr "积分网格的原子分区（VORONOI）"

msgid "Discarding grid points with tiny weights (WEIGHT_CUT)"
msgstr "丢弃具有极小权重的网格点 (WEIGHT_CUT)"

msgid "Grid symmetry (GRIDSYM,NOGRIDSYM)"
msgstr "网格对称性 (GRIDSYM,NOGRIDSYM)"

msgid ""
"switches off the use of symmetry in generating the integration grid, whereas"
msgstr "在生成积分网格时关闭对称性的使用，而"

msgid "forces the use of any point-group symmetry."
msgstr "强制使用任何点群对称性。"

msgid "Grid printing (GRIDPRINT)"
msgstr "网格打印 (GRIDPRINT)"

msgid ""
"controls printing of the grid, which by default is not done. At present, the"
" only possible value for *key* is ``GRID``, and *value* should be specified "
"as an integer. ``GRID=0`` causes the total number of integration points to "
"be evaluated and reported; ``GRID=1`` additionally shows the number of "
"points on each atom; ``GRID=2`` causes the complete set of grid points and "
"weights to be printed."
msgstr ""
"控制网格的打印，默认情况下不执行。目前，\\ *key* 唯一可能的值是 ``GRID``\\ ，而 *value* 应指定为整数。\\ "
"``GRID=0`` 会导致评估并报告积分点的总数；\\ ``GRID=1`` 额外显示每个原子上的点数；\\ ``GRID=2`` "
"导致打印完整的网格点集和权重。"

msgid "Orientation of atomic grids (ORIENT)"
msgstr "原子网格的取向 (ORIENT)"

msgid ""
"where ``prunmeth`` can be set to method identifiers in the range of 1 to 5 "
"(default is: ``prunemeth=1``)."
msgstr "其中 ``prunmeth`` 可以设置为 1 到 5 范围内的方法标识符（默认是：\\ ``prunemeth=1``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"with ``prunefunc=0`` being the default. The basic difference between "
"``prunefunc=0`` and ``prunefunc=1`` is that the former one only uses pair "
"Voronoi weights (leading to potentially linear scaling for large molecules) "
"while the latter is implemented with full Voronoi weights (cubic scaling of "
"the adaptive grid generation). ``prunefunc=1`` sometimes yields more "
"accurate results for small sized grids than ``prunefunc=0`` for GGA-type "
"functionals."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``prunefunc=0`` 为默认值。\\ ``prunefunc=0`` 与 ``prunefunc=1`` 的基本区别在于，前者仅使用对 "
"Voronoi 权重（可能导致大分子的线性标度），而后者使用完整的 Voronoi 权重实现（自适应网格生成具有立方标度）。对于 GGA 型泛函，\\ "
"``prunefunc=1`` 有时在小尺寸网格上比 ``prunefunc=0`` 产生更准确的结果。"

msgid ""
"A detailed description of the AMG method can be found in `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0119622>`__ **157**, 234106 (2022) which also "
"compares the accuracy yielded by the AMG grids to a range of other fixed "
"grid methods for thermochemical properties."
msgstr ""
"AMG 方法的详细描述可参见 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0119622>`__ "
"**157**, 234106 (2022)，该文还将 AMG 网格对热化学性质产生的精度与一系列其他固定网格方法进行了比较。"

msgid ""
"**Important note for calculations of open-shell atoms:** The adaptive grid "
"method can not properly set the angular grids for open-shell atoms, because "
"the pruning function is spherically symmetric and so very small angular "
"grids are assigned for each radial grid point. This, however, is not "
"sufficient for describing the spin orbitals properly on the grid. Therefore "
"it is necessary to explicitly change the grid settings for such cases in the"
" input file, using either"
msgstr ""
"**关于开壳层原子计算的重要说明：** "
"自适应网格方法无法为开壳层原子正确设置角向网格，因为剪枝函数是球对称的，因此为每个径向网格点分配了非常小的角向网格。然而，这不足以在网格上正确描述自旋轨道。因此，对于此类情况，有必要在输入文件中显式更改网格设置，使用以下任一方法："

msgid ""
"which raises the lowest possible angular momenta to :math:`L=31` (which "
"seems sufficient for, e.g., triplet carbon) or by using a fixed grid, e.g.:"
msgstr "这将最低可能的角动量提高到 :math:`L=31`\\ （例如，对于三重态碳似乎已足够），或者通过使用固定网格，例如："

msgid ""
"with ``anglevel=4`` using a medium sized grid, see section `Angular "
"integration grid <the_density_functional_program.html#angular-integration-"
"grid-angular>`__ for details."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``anglevel=4`` 使用中等大小的网格，详见 `角向积分网格 "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#angular-integration-grid-angular>`__ "
"一节。"

msgid "Fixed standard grids"
msgstr "固定标准网格"

msgid "``GRID,name=PRUNED``"
msgstr "``GRID,name=PRUNED``"

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid "``GRID,name=NEESE``"
msgstr "``GRID,name=NEESE``"

msgid "``GRID,name=SGx``"
msgstr "``GRID,name=SGx``"

msgid "with ``SGx``\\ =\\ ``SG0``,\\ ``SG1``,\\ ``SG2`` or ``SG3``."
msgstr "其中 ``SGx``\\ =\\ ``SG0``\\ 、\\ ``SG1``\\ 、\\ ``SG2`` 或 ``SG3``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``NEESE`` and ``SG`` are fixed-pruned grids and are defined in sections "
"`NEESE Grids (GRID,NAME=NEESE) <the_density_functional_program.html#neese-"
"grids-grid-name-neese>`__ and `SG Grids (GRID,name=SG) "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#sg-grids-grid-name-sg>`__ respectively."
" ``PRUNED`` grids compute angular order pruning on-the-fly based on the "
"molecular geometry. The ``PRUNED`` grid also features the most diverse set "
"of options that can be tuned to balance accuracy and grid size, see sections"
" `Radial integration grid <the_density_functional_program.html#radial-"
"integration-grid-radial>`__, `Angular integration grid "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#angular-integration-grid-angular>`__ "
"and `Atom partitioning of integration grid "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#atom-partitioning-of-integration-grid-"
"voronoi>`__."
msgstr ""
"``NEESE`` 和 ``SG`` 是固定修剪网格，分别在 `NEESE Grids (GRID,NAME=NEESE) "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#neese-grids-grid-name-neese>`__ 和 `SG "
"Grids (GRID,name=SG) <the_density_functional_program.html#sg-grids-grid-"
"name-sg>`__ 章节中定义。\\ ``PRUNED`` 网格根据分子几何结构动态计算角向阶次修剪。\\ ``PRUNED`` "
"网格还具有最多样化的选项集，可用于平衡精度和网格大小，请参阅 `Radial integration grid "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#radial-integration-grid-radial>`__\\ "
"、\\ `Angular integration grid <the_density_functional_program.html#angular-"
"integration-grid-angular>`__ 和 `Atom partitioning of integration grid "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#atom-partitioning-of-integration-grid-"
"voronoi>`__ 章节。"

msgid "Neese Grids (GRID,name=NEESE)"
msgstr "Neese 网格 (GRID,name=NEESE)"

msgid "The size of the grid should set using the ``neese_index``:"
msgstr "网格的大小应使用 ``neese_index`` 设置："

msgid "``grid,name=NEESE,neese_index=value``"
msgstr "``grid,name=NEESE,neese_index=value``"

msgid ""
"which links the angular size using ``neese_max_order`` and radial size using"
" ``neese_int_acc``, which are defined below. The ``value`` can be set from 3"
" to 12. Using ``neese_index=3`` sets ``neese_int_acc=4.34`` and "
"``neese_max_order=23``. Increasing the index by 1 increases "
"``neese_int_acc`` by 0.33 (effectively 5 radial points) and "
"``neese_max_order`` by 6."
msgstr ""
"它通过下文定义的 ``neese_max_order`` 关联角向尺寸，通过 ``neese_int_acc`` 关联径向尺寸。\\ ``value``"
" 可设置为 3 到 12。使用 ``neese_index=3`` 会设置 ``neese_int_acc=4.34`` 和 "
"``neese_max_order=23``\\ 。索引每增加 1，\\ ``neese_int_acc`` 增加 0.33（相当于 5 "
"个径向点），\\ ``neese_max_order`` 增加 6。"

msgid ""
"The grid is defined with 5 shells with boundaries at fixed radii. The "
"angular order of each shell is defined relative to a maximum order, "
":math:`m`, as :math:`m-18, m-12, m-6, m, m-6`. It can be set using:"
msgstr ""
"该网格定义为具有固定半径边界的 5 个壳层。每个壳层的角向阶次相对于最大阶次 :math:`m` 定义为 :math:`m-18, m-12, m-6,"
" m, m-6`\\ 。可通过以下方式设置："

msgid "``grid,name=NEESE,neese_max_order=value``"
msgstr "``grid,name=NEESE,neese_max_order=value``"

msgid ""
"Ahlrichs quadrature is used for the radial grid. The number of points used "
"for atom :math:`A` is defined by the Krack-Köster formula [1]:"
msgstr "径向网格使用 Ahlrichs 求积。原子 :math:`A` 使用的点数由 Krack-Köster 公式 [1] 定义："

msgid "n_{\\text{rad}}(A) = -5 (3 \\log 10^{-\\tt{int\\_acc}} - n_A + 8 )"
msgstr ""
"n_{\\text{rad}}(A) = -5 (3 \\log 10^{-\\tt{int\\_acc}} - n_A + 8 )\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"where :math:`n_A` is the period of atom :math:`A`. ``int_acc`` is set using:"
msgstr "其中 :math:`n_A` 是原子 :math:`A` 的周期。\\ ``int_acc`` 通过以下方式设置："

msgid "``grid,name=NEESE,neese_int_acc=value``"
msgstr "``grid,name=NEESE,neese_int_acc=value``"

msgid "where ``value`` would take values from 4.34 upwards."
msgstr "其中 ``value`` 的取值从 4.34 开始向上。"

msgid "SG Grids (GRID,name=SG)"
msgstr "SG 网格 (GRID,name=SG)"

msgid ""
"``SG2`` and ``SG3`` are larger fixed grids by Dasgupta and Herbert [3] that "
"were developed to achieve high accuracies for chemical properties. They are "
"based on the ``DE2`` (DoubleExp) radial quadrature scheme, see section "
"`Radial integration grid <the_density_functional_program.html#radial-"
"integration-grid-radial>`__."
msgstr ""
"``SG2`` 和 ``SG3`` 是由 Dasgupta 和 Herbert [3] 提出的更大的固定网格，旨在为化学性质实现高精度。它们基于 "
"``DE2`` (DoubleExp) 径向求积方案，参见章节 `径向积分网格 "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#radial-integration-grid-radial>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Density Functionals"
msgstr "密度泛函"

msgid ""
