"keywords. These can be entered, for example via ``{df-rks,pbe}`` (do a "
"single KS calculation with PBE) or ``{dfunc,pbe}`` (which will instruct all "
"following KS calculations to use PBE by default). The following table lists "
"the defined alias density functional combinations:"
msgstr ""
