msgstr "``INT`` 选择要使用的三中心积分例程（可以取值 1、2 或 3（默认值为 2））"

msgid ""
"It is also possible to reuse the exchange potential computed by the "
"LHF/DFLHF programs in a subsequent KS calculation. In this case, the "
"potential is kept fixed during the SCF and only the Coulomb potential is "
"variationally optimised. This can be done by, e.g. (’tlhf’ denoting "
"’Transformation Local Hartree-Fock’)"
msgstr ""
"也可以在后续的 KS 计算中重复使用由 LHF/DFLHF 程序计算的交换势。在这种情况下，势在 SCF 过程中保持固定，仅对 Coulomb "
"势进行变分优化。这可以通过以下方式完成，例如（'tlhf' 表示 'Transformation Local Hartree-Fock'）"

msgid "Optimised Effective Potential (OEP) method"
msgstr "优化有效势（OEP）方法"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, OEP methods can be numerically unstable if finite basis sets "
"are used (which is, of course, generally the case), see Refs. [3] and [4]. "
"The reason for this originates from the fact that the OEP equation is a "
"response-type equation where the underlying (static) KS response function is"
" described in terms of products of occupied and unoccupied orbitals. It "
"turns out that it generally is difficult to adequately represent the "
"(potentially linearly dependent) occ-virt space by an auxiliary function "
"space [3,4]. To be able to obtain physically sound OEP (exchange) "
"potentials, it is necessary to either employ regularisation techniques to "
"eliminate the small eigenvalues of the response matrix (see, e.g., T. "
"Heaton-Burgess, F. A. Bulat, W. Yang, `Phys. Rev. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.98.256401>`__ **98**, 256401 "
"(2007)), or to use auxiliary basis sets that are *balanced* to the orbital "
"basis set. As a rule of thumb, the attribute ’balanced’ here means that the "
"potential does not change anymore when the orbital basis space is increased "
"while the auxiliary basis set is kept fixed [4,5]."
msgstr ""
"不幸的是，如果使用有限基组（这当然是普遍情况），OEP方法可能在数值上不稳定，参见文献[3]和[4]。其原因在于OEP方程是一个响应型方程，其中基础的（静态）KS响应函数是用占据轨道和非占据轨道的乘积来描述的。事实证明，通常很难通过一个辅助函数空间来充分表示（可能线性相关的）占据-"
"虚轨道空间[3,4]。为了能够获得物理上合理的OEP（交换）势，有必要采用正则化技术来消除响应矩阵的小特征值（参见，例如，T. Heaton-"
"Burgess, F. A. Bulat, W. Yang, `Phys. Rev. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.98.256401>`__ **98**, 256401 "
"(2007)），或者使用与轨道基组\\ *平衡*\\ "
"的辅助基组。根据经验法则，这里的“平衡”属性意味着，当轨道基空间增加而辅助基组保持不变时，势能不再发生变化[4,5]。"

msgid ""
"Balanced orbital-auxiliary basis sets have been derived for a limited number"
" of elements in Ref. [5]. They can be specified in the basis input section "
"by"
msgstr "文献[5]中已经为有限数量的元素推导出了平衡的轨道-辅助基组。它们可以在基组输入部分通过以下方式指定"

msgid ""
"(see the oepbas.libmol file in the library directory for all available OEP "
"basis sets)."
msgstr "（有关所有可用的OEP基组，请参阅库目录中的oepbas.libmol文件）。"

msgid ""
"Auxiliary basis set OEP/EXX calculations based on the approach of Ref. [5] "
"can be performed with the EXX program, which, using the most essential "
"options, can be called as"
msgstr "基于文献[5]方法的辅助基组OEP/EXX计算可以使用EXX程序执行，该程序使用最基本的选项时，可以如下调用"

msgid ""
"where the supplement of previous orbitals in a given record is mandatory. "
"Furthermore, the options ``homo=1`` and ``charge=1`` activate the HOMO and "
"the charge constraints to the potential which adds to the numerical "
"stability of the OEP method, see Ref. [5]."
msgstr ""
"其中，在给定记录中补充先前的轨道是强制性的。此外，选项 ``homo=1`` 和 ``charge=1`` "
"激活了势的HOMO和电荷约束，这增加了OEP方法的数值稳定性，参见文献[5]。"

msgid ""
"Note that the OEP orbital basis sets are uncontracted and therefore "
"calculations for larger molecules can become quite expensive. Meaningful OEP"
" calculations can, however, also be performed with standard contracted basis"
" sets if some regularisation techniques are used in the solution to the OEP "
"equation. For this, it is recommended to use"
msgstr ""
"请注意，OEP轨道基组是非收缩的，因此对于较大分子的计算可能会变得相当昂贵。然而，如果在求解OEP方程时使用一些正则化技术，也可以使用标准的收缩基组进行有意义的OEP计算。为此，建议使用"

msgid ""
"where :math:`\\gamma` is a regularisation factor used in a Tikhonov "
"regularisation approach to the solution of the OEP equation, see Ref. [6]."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\gamma` 是用于求解OEP方程的Tikhonov正则化方法中的正则化因子，参见文献[6]。"

msgid "Further options to the EXX program are:"
msgstr "EXX程序的进一步选项包括："

msgid "``MAXIT`` maximum number of iterations"
msgstr "``MAXIT`` 最大迭代次数"

msgid "``SCFTHR`` threshold for energy convergence"
msgstr "``SCFTHR`` 能量收敛阈值"

msgid ""
"``OEP`` choose between 7 (!) different OEP routines (an explanation of all "
"these would blow up this section significantly, default is OEP=1)"
msgstr "``OEP`` 在7种(!)不同的OEP例程中选择（解释所有这些会显著增加本节篇幅，默认值为OEP=1）"

msgid "``PRINT`` debug print level"
msgstr "``PRINT`` 调试打印级别"

msgid "``FERAMA`` use Fermi-Amaldi potential (instead of OEP potential)"
msgstr "``FERAMA`` 使用Fermi-Amaldi势（代替OEP势）"

msgid ""
"``ELP`` use Effective Local Potential method by Staroverov *et al.* (`J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2345650>`__ **125**, 081104 "
"(2006))"
msgstr ""
"``ELP`` 使用 Staroverov 等人提出的有效局域势方法 (`J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2345650>`__ **125**, 081104 (2006))"

msgid ""
"``DFIT`` if set to :math:`\\ne` 0, use density fitting for two-electron "
"integrals"
msgstr "``DFIT`` 如果设置为 :math:`\\ne` 0，则对双电子积分使用密度拟合"

msgid ""
"``DIRECT`` set to :math:`\\ne` 0 for integral-direct calculation (not very "
"efficient at the moment)"
msgstr "``DIRECT`` 设置为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以进行积分直接计算（目前效率不高）"

msgid ""
"The underlying OEP module, that is called inside the EXX program, has the "
"further options:"
msgstr "在 EXX 程序内部调用的底层 OEP 模块，还有以下选项："

msgid ""
"``VREF`` can be set to ’BASIS’ or ’BASIS2’ according to the two schemes "
"described in Ref. [5] to determine the coefficients for the reference "
"potential"
msgstr "``VREF`` 可根据参考文献 [5] 中描述的两种方案设置为 'BASIS' 或 'BASIS2'，以确定参考势的系数"

msgid "``VREST`` can be set to zero to omit calculation of the rest potential"
msgstr "``VREST`` 可设置为零以省略剩余势的计算"

msgid "``AUX`` norm (should be ’J’)"
msgstr "``AUX`` 范数（应为 'J'）"

msgid ""
"``ATOM1`` set (x,y,z) coordinates for a starting position used for plotting "
"the potential"
msgstr "``ATOM1`` 设置用于绘制势能图的起始位置的 (x,y,z) 坐标"

msgid ""
"``ATOM2`` set (x,y,z) coordinates for a terminal position used for plotting "
"the potential"
msgstr "``ATOM2`` 设置用于绘制势能图的终止位置的 (x,y,z) 坐标"

msgid "``SYMCEN1/2`` do not use!"
msgstr "``SYMCEN1/2`` 请勿使用！"

msgid ""
"``TEST`` can be used to switch on several tests during the generation of the"
" OEP potential"
msgstr "``TEST`` 可用于在生成 OEP 势能期间开启若干测试"

msgid ""
"``POT`` enter a name of the file to which the potential is written to (along"
" a line that can be specified with ATOM1/2, see above)"
msgstr "``POT`` 输入一个文件名，势能将被写入该文件（沿着一条可通过 ATOM1/2 指定的线，见上文）"

msgid "``CHARGE`` set to :math:`\\ne` 0 for activating the charge condition"
msgstr "``CHARGE`` 设置为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以激活电荷条件"

msgid "``HOMO`` set to :math:`\\ne` 0 for activating the HOMO condition"
msgstr "``HOMO`` 设置为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以激活 HOMO 条件"

msgid ""
"``HOMO1`` can additionally be used to fix the orbital energy of an orbital "
"whose energy lies below the HOMO level (is not available for all OEP "
"routines)"
msgstr "``HOMO1`` 可额外用于固定能量低于 HOMO 能级的轨道的轨道能量（并非所有 OEP 程序都可用）"

msgid ""
"``RESPEIG`` set to :math:`\\ne` 0 to print out the eigenvalues of the "
"response matrix (useful to test stability of the OEP method)"
msgstr "``RESPEIG`` 设为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以打印响应矩阵的特征值（用于测试 OEP 方法的稳定性）"

msgid ""
"``RHS`` set to :math:`\\ne` 0 for printing the right-hand side in the output"
msgstr "``RHS`` 设为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以在输出中打印右侧项"

msgid "``XPRINT`` set to :math:`\\ne` 0 for printing the response matrix"
msgstr "``XPRINT`` 设为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以打印响应矩阵"

msgid ""
"``SOLVE`` matrix inversion methods to solve the OEP equation. The different "
"options are: GESV (default), SVD, SVD2, TIKH"
msgstr "``SOLVE`` 用于求解 OEP 方程的矩阵求逆方法。不同选项为：GESV（默认）、SVD、SVD2、TIKH"

msgid ""
"``THR`` threshold value for singular value decomposition (SVD) or Tikhonov "
"regularisation (TIKH)"
msgstr "``THR`` 奇异值分解（SVD）或 Tikhonov 正则化（TIKH）的阈值"

msgid ""
"``FILTER`` an integer number can be entered to filter out the response "
"function eigenvectors with the lowest eigenvalues in an SVD matrix inversion"
msgstr "``FILTER`` 可输入一个整数，用于在 SVD 矩阵求逆中滤除具有最低特征值的响应函数特征向量"

msgid ""
"``SVD`` here, SVD is used to perform a singular value decomposition of the "
"(aux\\ :math:`|`\\ occ\\ :math:`\\times`\\ virt) 3-index integrals"
msgstr ""
"``SVD`` 此处，SVD 用于对 (aux\\ :math:`|`\\ occ\\ :math:`\\times`\\ virt) "
"三中心积分进行奇异值分解"

msgid "``SVDTHR`` the corresponding SVD threshold for this"
msgstr "``SVDTHR`` 对应的 SVD 阈值"

msgid ""
"``CONTR`` set to :math:`\\ne` 0 to use contraction of auxiliary basis "
"through the SVD of (aux\\ :math:`|`\\ occ\\ :math:`\\times`\\ virt) "
"integrals"
msgstr ""
"``CONTR`` 设置为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以通过对 (aux\\ :math:`|`\\ occ\\ :math:`\\times`\\"
" virt) 积分进行 SVD 来使用辅助基组的收缩"

msgid ""
"``LAPLACE`` solve OEP within the AO basis set making use of the Laplace "
"transformation"
msgstr "``LAPLACE`` 在原子轨道基组内利用拉普拉斯变换求解 OEP"

msgid "``VXDUMP`` dump the nonlocal and local exchange potentials to a record"
msgstr "``VXDUMP`` 将非局域和局域交换势转储到记录中"

msgid ""
"``OEPDUMP`` dump record for OEP which contains the orbitals, the density and"
" the eigenvalues"
msgstr "``OEPDUMP`` 为 OEP 转储记录，其中包含轨道、密度和本征值"

msgid ""
"``SAVE`` record in which the coefficients of the potential can be written to"
msgstr "``SAVE`` 可写入势系数的记录"

msgid "``READ`` record from which the coefficients can be read"
msgstr "``READ`` 可从中读取系数的记录"

msgid "``OEPPRINT`` debug print level"
msgstr "``OEPPRINT`` 调试打印级别"

msgid ""
"``HOMOORB`` specify an orbital dump record from a previous calculation used "
"to determine the vector for the HOMO condition (useful if the HOMO swaps "
"with a lower lying level with a different method)"
msgstr "``HOMOORB`` 指定来自先前计算的轨道转储记录，用于确定 HOMO 条件的向量（当 HOMO 与使用不同方法的较低能级交换时有用）"

msgid ""
"``FIXEIG`` can be used to specify the number of an orbital whose eigenvalue "
"should be fixed (see also HOMO1 option)"
msgstr "``FIXEIG`` 可用于指定一个轨道的编号，其本征值应被固定（另见 HOMO1 选项）"

msgid ""
"``EQNORM`` set the norm for the OEP equation (not available for all OEP "
"routines)"
msgstr "``EQNORM`` 设置 OEP 方程的范数（并非所有 OEP 例程都可用）"

msgid "``ELPMODE`` switch the mode in ELP calculations"
msgstr "``ELPMODE`` 切换 ELP 计算中的模式"

msgid ""
"``EXIT`` can be used to deallocate some arrays that are used during the OEP "
"calculation"
msgstr "``EXIT`` 可用于释放 OEP 计算期间使用的一些数组"

msgid ""
"``CONV`` threshold for testing the energy convergence. When the energy "
"change is below this threshold, the exchange potential will be kept fixed "
"and will not be calculated anymore."
msgstr "``CONV`` 测试能量收敛的阈值。当能量变化低于此阈值时，交换势将保持固定且不再计算。"

msgid ""
"``VXDIFF`` specify a record number for a record in which to write the matrix"
" :math:`\\langle i|v_x^{\\text{NL}}-v_x|j\\rangle` containing the difference"
" of the nonlocal and the local exact exchange potentials. This is required "
"in TDDFT calculations employing the exact-exchange KS kernel."
msgstr ""
"``VXDIFF`` 指定一个记录号，用于写入包含非局域与局域精确交换势之差的矩阵 :math:`\\langle "
"i|v_x^{\\text{NL}}-v_x|j\\rangle`\\ 。这在采用精确交换 KS 核的 TDDFT 计算中是必需的。"

msgid ""
"``THRS`` an eigenvalue threshold used in the decomposition of the overlap "
"matrix, used to reduce the auxiliary function space (not available in all "
"OEP routines)"
msgstr "``THRS`` 用于重叠矩阵分解的本征值阈值，用于缩减辅助函数空间（并非所有 OEP 例程都可用）"

msgid ""
"``GAMMA`` Tikhonov regularisation factor (only used for OEP=7 case). A value"
" of :math:`\\gamma=3\\cdot 10^{-4}` should conventionally be used."
msgstr ""
"``GAMMA`` Tikhonov 正则化因子（仅用于 OEP=7 的情况）。通常应使用 :math:`\\gamma=3\\cdot "
"10^{-4}` 的值。"

