msgstr "``ADD`` 设置为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以便将 GGA 对 xc 矩阵的贡献加到 OEP 方程的右侧"

msgid ""
"``SHIFT`` if set to a value :math:`\\ne` 0 the asymptotic correction method "
