msgstr "即在泛函列表后附加非局域泛函关键词 ``vv10nl``\\ 。进一步的泛函特定输入可以通过例如"

msgid "Empirical damped dispersion correction"
msgstr "经验阻尼色散校正"

msgid ""
"Empirical damped dispersion corrections can be calculated in addition to "
"Kohn-Sham calculations. This is particularly important in cases where long-"
"range correlation effects become dominant."
msgstr "除了Kohn-Sham计算外，还可以计算经验阻尼色散校正。这在长程相关效应占主导地位的情况下尤为重要。"

msgid "The dispersion correction can be added to the DFT energy by using"
msgstr "可以通过以下方式将色散校正添加到DFT能量中"

