msgstr "总能量将按如下方式计算"

msgid "E_{\\text{DFT-D2}}=E_{\\text{DFT}}+E_{\\text{disp}}(\\mbox{D2})"
msgstr ""
"E_{\\text{DFT-D2}}=E_{\\text{DFT}}+E_{\\text{disp}}(\\mbox{D2})\n"
"\n"

msgid "if :math:`x=d4` (see Ref. [4])."
msgstr "若 :math:`x=d4`\\ （参见文献[4]）。"

msgid ""
"Currently the default dispersion correction added to the DFT energy is the "
"D4 dispersion correction developed by Grimme *et al.*, see Ref. [4]."
msgstr "当前添加到DFT能量中的默认色散校正是由Grimme等人开发的D4色散校正，参见文献[4]。"

msgid "The ``disp,d3`` keyword can have the following additional options:"
msgstr "``disp,d3`` 关键字可以有以下附加选项："

