"Example of a PBE calculation on the fractional C cation with 5.3 electrons:"
msgstr "在具有 5.3 个电子的分数 C 阳离子上进行 PBE 计算的示例："

msgid ""
"Example of a RSH calculation on the fractional CO anion with 14.8 electrons:"
msgstr "在具有 14.8 个电子的分数 CO 阴离子上进行 RSH 计算的示例："

msgid ""
"Example of a HF calculation on the H atom with 0.5 alpha electron and 0.5 "
"beta electron:"
msgstr "在具有 0.5 个 alpha 电子和 0.5 个 beta 电子的 H 原子上进行 HF 计算的示例："

msgid ""
"Subsequent RPA correlation calculations (see `here <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#random-phase-approximation-rpatddft-program>`__) "
"will be automatically done with fractional orbital occupation numbers."
msgstr ""
"后续的RPA关联计算（参见\\ `此处 <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#random-"
"phaseapproximationrpatddftprogram>`__\\ ）将自动使用分数轨道占据数进行。"

